('100017', '100017', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', '10 AM - 12 PM', 'Seed''s ''Monday closed / Tue-Sun 10 AM-5 PM'' is wrong: NOT closed Monday; afternoon-evening opening Mon-Sat. Vizagtourism.org.in also notes Sunday morning window 10 AM-12 PM then 2-8:30 PM. [verified: Indian Navy official page listing (indiannavy.nic.in); corroborated by vizagtourism.org.in, holidify.com, tripoto.com] | Deep-check 2026-09-30: Tue-Sat 2:00-8:30 PM; Sun 10 AM-12 PM and 2:00-8:30 PM (per prior pass) [src: Indian Navy official page via prior verification]'),
