('100235', '1010', 'Havelock Bridge Rajahmundry', 'Havelock Bridge', 'Walk the decommissioned 1897 rail bridge over the Godavari; a heritage engineering icon.', '1-2 hours', 'Evening', 'Sunset walks on the bridge with the Godavari below are the classic Rajahmundry experience.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '1', '', '6:00 PM', 'free', 4.5, 4.4, 17.0, 81.78, 'Rajahmundry, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.84, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Old Godavari (Havelock) Bridge exists at Rajahmundry/Kovvur. File''s ''decommissioned 1897'' is wrong: construction began 11 Nov 1897, opened 30 Aug 1900, decommissioned 1997. Pedestrian walkway conversion planned (revamp for Godavari Pushkarams 2027) but not yet open; no authoritative source publishes visitor hours. No dedicated search was run for Havelock Bridge in this pass. The Phase-B search keyed to this id actually targeted ''Kadiyapulanka nurseries'' - its findings were reassigned to 100245 (Kadiam Flower Nurseries). Verification report (2026-09-30): Old Godavari (Havelock) Bridge exists at Rajahmundry/Kovvur; construction began 11 Nov 1897, opened 30 Aug 1900, decommissioned 1997; pedestrian-walkway conversion planned (revamp for Godavari Pushkarams 2027) but not yet open; no authoritative source publishes visitor hours.', '2026-09-30'),
('100236', '1010', 'Pushkar Ghat Rajahmundry', 'Pushkar Ghat', 'The main Godavari ghat, centre of the Pushkaralu festival every 12 years.', '1-2 hours', 'Evening', 'Evening harathi at the ghat is atmospheric; check timings locally.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '1', '1', '6:00 AM', '6:00 PM', 'free', 4.4, 4.3, 17.01, 81.77, 'Rajahmundry, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.81, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Pushkar Ghat exists in Rajahmundry; evening Godavari harathi ~6:30-7:30 PM daily per travel sources. No authoritative source publishes ghat hours (travel listings show open 24 hours); file''s 5 AM-9 PM unverifiable. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Madduru Subbanna temple'' and found no specific source - no usable data. Verification report (2026-09-30): Pushkar Ghat exists in Rajahmundry; evening Godavari harathi ~6:30-7:30 PM daily per travel sources; travel listings show open 24 hours; no authoritative published hours.', '2026-09-30'),
('100237', '1010', 'Dowleswaram Barrage', 'Cotton Barrage', 'Sir Arthur Cotton 1852 engineering marvel across the Godavari.', '1 hour', 'Evening', 'The barrage viewpoint at sunset shows the full river spread.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '1', '', '6:00 PM', 'free', 4.3, 4.2, 16.9308, 81.7658, 'Dowleswaram, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', NULL, 0.76, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Barrage exists: construction began 1847, completed 1852, retrofitted 1970, renamed Sir Arthur Cotton Barrage. In Dowleswaram (~8-10 km from Rajahmundry), not Rajahmundry itself. File coords 16.93, 81.87 are ~11 km off; real ~16.9308, 81.7658. Official site is AP Water Resources Dept portal. No published viewpoint hours. Official website dead as of 2026-09-30; URL removed. Official AP Water Resources portal unresolvable (2026-09-30); do NOT retry. No published viewpoint hours per verification report.', '2026-09-30'),
('100238', '1010', 'Papikondalu Boat Trip', 'Papikondalu Cruise', 'The famous Godavari gorge boat journey through the Papi Hills.', 'Full day', 'Morning', 'Book the APTDC or private cruise in advance; the day trip includes lunch on board.', 'Cruise booking required', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.8, 4.7, 17.05, 81.7, 'Papikondalu, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', 'https://tourism.ap.gov.in/toursList?type=Road&groupCode=3&serviceCode=40', 0.91, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'mid', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'APTDC cruises operate: Rajahmundry-Gandipochamma-Papikondalu dep 7:00 AM / arr 8:00 PM; Pochavaram-Papikondalu dep 9:00 AM / arr 6:30 PM (APTDC schedule). Boat tourism resumed July 5, 2026. Tours run on published cruise schedules, not fixed daily hours; file''s 7 AM-6 PM unverifiable. Boats board at Rajahmundry/Pattiseema/Pochavaram jetties. Official site blocked by rate-limit during check (2026-09-30); re-verify URL before use. APTDC tours page returned HTTP 429 rate-limit (2026-09-30); do NOT retry. Website status unknown - re-check manually.', '2026-09-30'),
('100239', '1010', 'Papikonda National Park', 'Papikonda National Park', 'Forest reserve in the Papi Hills with tigers, leopards and rich birdlife.', 'Half day', 'Morning', 'Permits are needed; go through the forest department or a cruise operator.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.3, 4.2, 17.1, 81.65, 'Papikondalu, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.77, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'mid', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'renamed', 'Exists: sanctuary since 1978, National Park 2008 (~1,068 sq km) in Papi Hills; official spelling ''Papikonda''. Spans Alluri Sitharama Raju and Eluru districts, not Rajahmundry; parts threatened by Polavaram submergence. No authoritative hours or permit details published. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Talariva'' and returned no place-specific results - no usable data for this row. Context only: AP govt''s reported Rs 15-20 beach entry fee policy (Outlook Traveller) - implementation unverified.', '2026-09-30'),
('100240', '1010', 'Draksharamam Bhimeswara Temple', 'Draksharamam Temple', 'A Pancharama Kshetra Shiva temple with a tall gopuram and ancient inscriptions.', '2 hours', 'Morning', 'One of the five Pancharama temples; combine with Samalkota.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.6, 4.5, 16.8, 82.06, 'Draksharamam, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', NULL, 0.85, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'verified', 'Exists; official fuller name ''Draksharama Manikyambadevi Sametha Bheemeswara Swami Temple'' (Pancharama + 12th Shakti Peetha). In Draksharamam, Konaseema district, ~50 km from Rajahmundry. Some sources say afternoon break ~12 PM-3 PM vs file''s 1-3 PM. Official website dead as of 2026-09-30; URL removed. AP Endowments TMS portal returned HTTP 500 on 3 attempts (2026-09-30); do NOT retry.', '2026-09-30'),
('100241', '1010', 'Annavaram Satyanarayana Temple', 'Annavaram Temple', 'The hilltop temple famous for the Satyanarayana Vratham performed by lakhs yearly.', '3 hours', 'Morning', 'Book the vratham ticket online; walk-in slots fill fast on auspicious days.', 'Vratham booking recommended', 'Andhra Pradesh', '1', '0', '6:00 AM', '', 'free', 4.7, 4.6, 17.29, 82.4, 'Annavaram, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', 'https://annavaramdevasthanam.nic.in/', 0.88, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Exists; official name ''Sri Veera Venkata Satyanarayana Swamy Vari Devasthanam'', Ratnagiri Hill, Annavaram, Kakinada district (~72 km from Rajahmundry). Official site live but publishes no hours; third-party sources report darshan 6:00 AM-12:30 PM & 1:00-9:00 PM (file says 5 AM-9 PM, misses break). Online vratham booking confirmed. Official devasthanam site loads but is JS-heavy; no hours or prices extracted in this pass.', '2026-09-30'),
('100242', '1010', 'Ryali Jaganmohini Temple', 'Ryali Temple', 'Famous for the Jaganmohini-Kesava shrine where Vishnu is in female form.', '1-2 hours', 'Morning', 'The idol legend is unique; ask the priest for the story.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.3, 4.2, 16.78, 81.83, 'Ryali, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.76, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Exists at Ryali, East Godavari (Atreyapuram mandal), ~35 km from Rajahmundry; unique two-sided idol (Jaganmohini/Kesava). No official website. Third-party sources report 6 AM-12 PM & 3-8 PM (differs from file''s 6 AM-8 PM) but none authoritative; hours unverified. REASSIGNED: these findings come from the Phase-B search for ''Ryali Jaganmohini Keshava'' which was keyed to place_id 100247 but unambiguously describes this temple. The search keyed to THIS id targeted ''Pithapuram (Puruhutika Shakti Peetham)'' - different place, not applied here.', '2026-09-30'),
('100243', '1010', 'Samalkota Kumararama Temple', 'Samalkota Temple', 'A Pancharama Kshetra with Chalukya-era architecture and a 60-ft lingam.', '1-2 hours', 'Morning', 'The temple tank and mandapa carvings deserve a slow walk.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.5, 4.4, 17.05, 82.17, 'Samalkota, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', 'https://tms.ap.gov.in/', 0.82, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'verified', 'Exists; official name ''Sri Chalukya Kumararama Bhimeswara Swamy Temple'' (Pancharama, Chalukya Bhima 892-922 CE). In Samalkota, Kakinada district (~52 km from Rajahmundry). Travel sources report split 6 AM-12 PM & 4-8 PM, but TMS (authoritative) lists continuous 6-8. AP Endowments homepage loads (generic portal); no temple-specific hours or prices extracted.', '2026-09-30'),
('100244', '1010', 'Kukkuteswara Temple Pithapuram', 'Pithapuram Temple', 'An ancient Shiva temple in Pithapuram, one of the Shakti Peethas region.', '1-2 hours', 'Morning', 'Combine with the Pada Gaya shrine in the same town.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.4, 4.3, 17.12, 82.26, 'Pithapuram, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.79, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Exists: Kukkuteswara Swamy Temple, Pithapuram; Shakti Peetha on premises is Sri Puruhutika Devi (10th Shakti Peetha). In Pithapuram, Kakinada district (~20 km from Kakinada). No official website. Third-party sources report 5/5:30 AM-12:30 PM & 4:30-8:30 PM (differs from file''s 6 AM-8 PM); none authoritative. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Tallarevu'' and returned no usable results. A separate search keyed to 100242 targeted ''Pithapuram (Puruhutika Shakti Peetham)'' and found: 5 AM-8:30 PM daily (Justdial, 785 ratings); padagaya.com listed as official site. That is the Shakti peetha in the same town, NOT this Shiva temple - hours NOT applied here; kept as context only.', '2026-09-30'),
('100245', '1010', 'Kadiam Flower Nurseries', 'Kadiam Nurseries', 'Vast flower nurseries around Kadiyapulanka; best in December-February.', '1-2 hours', 'Morning', 'December to February is peak bloom; buy saplings directly from growers.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'No entry fee found', 4.1, 4.2, 16.92, 81.83, 'Kadiam, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.71, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real: Kadiyapulanka/Kadiam area near Rajahmundry is a famous nursery hub (''nursery village''), genuine visitor/photography attraction ~10 miles from Rajahmundry. Spelling varies: Kadiam vs Kadiyam (official mandal spelling Kadiyam). An area of many nurseries, not one attraction; no single hours or website. [Price source: Justdial listings (Google search 2026-09-30)] REASSIGNED: these findings come from the Phase-B search for ''Kadiyapulanka nurseries'' keyed to place_id 100235; Kadiyam/Kadiyapulanka are the same flower-nursery belt near Rajahmundry, so this is the matching row. Commercial nurseries, daytime hours; no entry fee found. The search keyed to THIS id targeted ''Ainavilli Siddhi Vinayaka'' - different place, not applied here (no specific source was found for it anyway).', '2026-09-30'),
('100246', '1010', 'Sir Arthur Cotton Museum Rajahmundry', 'Cotton Museum', 'Museum dedicated to Sir Arthur Cotton and the Godavari irrigation story.', '1 hour', 'Morning', 'Good context before visiting the Dowleswaram barrage.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.0, 3.9, 17.005, 81.775, 'Rajahmundry, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.66, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'verified', 'Real and open to public, dedicated to Sir Arthur Thomas Cotton, at Cotton Peta, Dhavaleswaram, Rajahmundry (est. 1988, state govt). Some third-party sites report 10:30 AM-5:00/6:30 PM with Tuesday closure; authoritative listing says 10:00 AM-6:00 PM all days — re-check at visit time. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Mandapalli Saneswara'' - different place, not applied. Hours above are from the verification report (2026-09-30): museum is real, at Cotton Peta, Dhavaleswaram (est. 1988, state govt); hours conflict - re-check at visit time.', '2026-09-30'),
('100247', '1010', 'Maredumilli Forests', 'Maredumilli', 'Forest waterfalls, bamboo groves and the famous bamboo chicken country.', 'Full day', 'Morning', 'Stay overnight in a forest resort; the waterfalls need a full day.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.5, 4.6, 17.3541, 81.4243, 'Maredumilli, Alluri Sitharama Raju, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.86, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'mid', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real eco-tourism spot but NOT near Rajahmundry: Alluri Sitharama Raju district, ~90 km (2.5+ hr drive) away. File coords 17.60, 81.72 are ~40 km off; real ~17.3541, 81.4243. Forest resort stays real (AP tourism jungle resorts). No single official hours for the area (e.g. Amruthadhara falls 9 AM-5 PM). The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Ryali Jaganmohini Keshava'' - that temple''s findings were reassigned to 100242. No usable forest-specific data from this pass.', '2026-09-30'),
('100248', '1010', 'Dwaraka Tirumala Temple', 'Chinna Tirupati', 'The Chinna Tirupati temple, a major pilgrimage centre in Eluru district.', '2-3 hours', 'Morning', 'Less crowded than Tirupati with an equally grand temple experience.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.5, 4.4, 16.57, 81.15, 'Dwaraka Tirumala, Eluru, Andhra Pradesh', 'https://www.dwarakatirumala.org/', 0.83, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real major Venkateswara temple, officially ''Sri Venkateswara Swamy Vari Devasthanam, Dwaraka Tirumala'' (Chinna Tirupati), Eluru district ~110 km from Rajahmundry. Official site confirmed live but publishes no hours; third-party sources mostly report 4:00 AM-9:30 PM (file says 5 AM-9 PM) — unverified. Official temple site loads; no hours or prices extracted in this pass.', '2026-09-30'),
('100249', '1010', 'Sri Golingeswara Swamy Temple, Bikkavolu', 'Bikkavolu Temple', 'A Chalukya-era Shiva temple with intricate carvings.', '1 hour', 'Morning', 'The carvings are Chalukya finest; a quiet heritage stop.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.2, 4.1, 16.95, 82.02, 'Bikkavolu, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.72, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'renamed', 'Real Eastern Chalukya-era (849-892 AD) Shiva temple in Bikkavolu, East Godavari, ~35 km from Rajahmundry. Spelling is ''Golingeswara Swamy'' (village also Biccavolu), not ''Golingeswara''. Temple-hour reports conflict widely across third-party sites; no official trust website. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Peddapuram Maridamma'' - a different temple/town; findings (6:30 AM-8:30 PM daily per Justdial, 1,622 ratings; famous 31-day Maridamma festival Jyeshtha->Ashadha Amavasya) NOT applied here. No SQL row exists for Maridamma; findings kept here as context only.', '2026-09-30'),
('100250', '1010', 'Peddapuram Ancient Temples', 'Peddapuram Temples', 'An old temple town with historic shrines and traditional streets.', '1-2 hours', 'Morning', 'Walk the old streets; the temples are spread through the town.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'free', 4.1, 4.0, 17.08, 82.13, 'Peddapuram, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.68, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real temple-town in Kakinada district (~42 km NE of Rajahmundry via NH-16): Pandavula Metta / Sri Suryanarayana Swamy Temple with ancient caves, Maridamma temple, 52-ft Anjaneya statue near Samalkota. No official hours published; temple-typical hours unverifiable. No search was run for this row in this pass (the pending ''Chagallu'' search targeted a different subject). Verification report (2026-09-30): Peddapuram is a real temple town in Kakinada district (~42 km NE of Rajahmundry via NH-16): Pandavula Metta / Sri Suryanarayana Swamy Temple with ancient caves, Maridamma temple, 52-ft Anjaneya statue near Samalkota; no official hours published, temple-typical hours unverifiable.', '2026-09-30'),
('100251', '1010', 'Kakinada Beach Uppada', 'Uppada Beach', 'A long beach near Kakinada, calmer than the main town beach.', '2-3 hours', 'Evening', 'Evenings are pleasant; the lighthouse area is the nicest stretch.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '1', '', '6:00 PM', 'free', 4.2, 4.3, 17.07, 82.33, 'Uppada, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.74, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real beach at Uppada village, ~5 km from Kakinada (Kakinada district) — ~65 km from Rajahmundry, not a Rajahmundry-area beach. File coords 16.95, 82.28 are ~15 km south of actual Uppada beach (~17.07, 82.33). No official site or published hours; travel sources say 5 AM-6 PM, none authoritative. No search was run for this row in this pass (the pending ''Kadiyam'' search targeted a different subject). Verification report: real beach at Uppada village ~5 km from Kakinada (~65 km from Rajahmundry, not a Rajahmundry-area beach); travel sources say 5 AM-6 PM, none authoritative. Context: AP govt''s reported Rs 15-20 beach entry fee policy (Outlook Traveller) - implementation unverified.', '2026-09-30'),
('100252', '1010', 'Coringa Wildlife Sanctuary', 'Coringa Sanctuary', 'A mangrove forest sanctuary with boardwalks and rich birdlife.', '2-3 hours', 'Morning', 'Take the boat ride through the mangrove creeks.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.3, 4.4, 16.8, 82.33, 'Coringa, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', 'https://forests.ap.gov.in/sanctuaries.php', 0.78, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'verified', 'Confirmed real: 235 sq km mangrove sanctuary (est. 1978) on Godavari estuary near Kakinada (~20 km), ~70 km from Rajahmundry — not near Rajahmundry. Main entrance at Thallarevu (~16.88, 82.25). Official AP Forest Dept sanctuaries page loads; no Coringa-specific hours or prices extracted.', '2026-09-30'),
('100253', '1010', 'Hope Island Kakinada', 'Hope Island', 'A sand island off Kakinada reachable by boat, with quiet beaches.', 'Half day', 'Morning', 'Boats leave from the Kakinada fishing harbour; go in the morning.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'APTDC boat Rs 200/person from Kakinada fishing harbour; tickets only at counter, minimum 10 tickets or Rs 2,000', 4.2, 4.3, 16.98, 82.32, 'Hope Island, Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.73, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real, visitable sand island ~7 km off Kakinada; tourists reach via APTDC boats from Kakinada fishing harbour (older reports: daily ~10 AM; confirm current schedule with APTDC). No facilities on island. Hours are trip-based, not fixed attraction hours. [Price source: hellokakinada.in / Tripadvisor reviews (Google search 2026-09-30)] Boat access details per hellokakinada.in and Tripadvisor reviews.', '2026-09-30'),
('100254', '1010', 'Polavaram Dam View Point', 'Polavaram Project', 'Viewpoint over the massive Polavaram irrigation project site.', '1 hour', 'Evening', 'The scale of the project is best appreciated from the viewpoint.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '1', '', '6:00 PM', 'free', 4.0, 4.1, 17.25, 81.65, 'Polavaram, Eluru, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.67, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'attraction', NULL, 'budget', 'na', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'renamed', 'Real public viewpoint: ''Polavaram Project View Point'' at Paidipaka near the Polavaram dam site, Eluru district — 100+ km NW of Rajahmundry, not a Rajahmundry-area POI. CM has proposed developing it as a tourism destination. No official site or published hours; access is to an active construction zone, may be restricted during monsoon/flood operations. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Rajahmundry food spots'' - findings (Devi Chowk Khau Galli street food: Maa Palle Dosa 4.1, Rs 150 for two, open till 9:30 PM; Srinivas Mixture brinjal bajji; Srilakshmi Fruit Juice Corner; Rajahmundry rose milk - Justdial/YouTube) describe the city''s food scene, NOT this viewpoint; not applied. No SQL row exists for Rajahmundry food spots. Verification report (2026-09-30): real viewpoint ''Polavaram Project View Point'' at Paidipaka near the dam site, Eluru district, 100+ km NW of Rajahmundry; no official site or published hours.', '2026-09-30'),
('100256', '1010', 'Subbayya Gari Hotel Kakinada', 'Subbayya Gari Hotel', 'The legendary Kakinada Andhra meals institution.', '1 hour', 'Afternoon', 'Go for lunch; the meals are the main event, arrive hungry.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.5, 4.4, 16.96, 82.24, 'Kakinada, Andhra Pradesh', NULL, 0.82, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'restaurant', 'Andhra', 'mid', 'veg-options', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'verified', 'Legendary Andhra-meals hotel confirmed in Kakinada (Subbayya hotel junction; est. 1992) — correctly flagged as Kakinada, not Rajahmundry. Official website dead as of 2026-09-30; URL removed. Domain unresolvable (2026-09-30); do NOT retry. FLAG FOR WEBSITE REMOVAL in SQL.', '2026-09-30'),
('100257', '1010', 'Ayyappa Family Restaurant Rajahmundry', 'Ayyappa Rajahmundry', 'Family restaurant with Andhra meals and tiffins.', '1 hour', 'Afternoon', 'Good value meals near the town centre.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'Rs 1-200 per person', 3.9, 3.9, 17.002, 81.776, 'Rajahmundry, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.61, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'restaurant', 'Andhra', 'budget', 'veg-options', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'unverified', 'No restaurant with the exact name ''Ayyappa Family Restaurant'' found in Rajahmundry. Closest matches: ''Hotel Sarvana Ayyappa A/C'' (near Gokavaram Bus Stand) and ''Saranam Ayyappa Vegetarian Meals'' (Kotheru Rd). Verify which establishment this entry refers to before keeping. [Price source: restaurant-guru.in / Justdial (Google search 2026-09-30)] REASSIGNED: these findings come from the Phase-B search for ''Ayyappa restaurant'' keyed to place_id 100258; they describe Hotel Sarvana Ayyappa A/C (near Gokavaram Bus Stand, Arya Puram; 4.1 Google rating; Justdial 4.1, 190 ratings, pure veg, opens 11 AM) - almost certainly the same establishment under a name variant, so applied to this row. The search keyed to THIS id targeted ''Surya Dine-In'' and found no such restaurant in Rajahmundry (only unrelated Surya Clinic/Hotel Surya elsewhere).', '2026-09-30'),
('100258', '1010', 'Kritunga Restaurant Rajahmundry', 'Kritunga Rajahmundry', 'Andhra meals chain with traditional flavors and banana leaf service.', '1 hour', 'Afternoon', 'The veg meals are generous and well priced.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.0, 3.9, 17.004, 81.778, 'Rajahmundry, East Godavari, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.64, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'restaurant', 'Andhra', 'mid', 'veg-options', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Kritunga chain branch confirmed in Rajahmundry (Vijay Sales Building, Jawaharlal Nehru Rd, Gandhipuram; reviews as recent as Mar 2026). Chain site kritunga.in is parked/dead. One listing marks the branch permanently closed but Justdial/magicpin listings look current — verify live status. Split lunch/dinner sessions (11 AM-3:30 PM, 6-10:30 PM) per Justdial, not 11 AM-11 PM continuous. [Transcription fix 2026-09-30: name_ok set true per source report - branch confirmed to exist; only live/open status is uncertain.] No Kritunga-specific search was run in this pass (the search keyed to this id targeted ''Ayyappa restaurant''; its findings were reassigned to 100257). Note: the Nellore Kritunga website (kritungarestaurant.com) is hijacked by a gambling site - do not copy any URL to this row without checking.', '2026-09-30'),
('100259', '1010', 'Maredumilli Bamboo Chicken Stalls', 'Maredumilli Bamboo Chicken', 'Forest stalls cooking bamboo chicken, the signature dish of the region.', '1 hour', 'Evening', 'Eat it fresh off the fire; the forest setting adds to it.', '', 'Andhra Pradesh', '0', '0', '', '', 'paid', 4.4, 4.3, 17.601, 81.721, 'Maredumilli, Alluri Sitharama Raju, Andhra Pradesh', '', 0.79, '2026-09-30 12:00:00', NULL, 'restaurant', 'Tribal Street Food', 'budget', 'non-veg', 'own', '2026-09-30 12:00:00', 'partial', 'Real, well-known food experience: cluster of bamboo-chicken stalls on the Rajahmundry-Bhadrachalam Hwy around Maredumilli. Not a single restaurant, so per-stall hours vary; file''s 11 AM-9 PM is broadly plausible but unverified. The Phase-B search keyed to this id targeted ''Bhimas (Hotel Bhimas)'' - different place; findings (Zomato 7 AM-11 PM Stadium Road branch, Rs 160 for two per Justdial) NOT applied here; no SQL row exists for Bhimas. Verification report: real, well-known food experience - cluster of bamboo-chicken stalls on the Rajahmundry-Bhadrachalam Hwy around Maredumilli; not a single restaurant so per-stall hours vary; 11 AM-9 PM broadly plausible but unverified.', '2026-09-30');

