-- * canonical supplied state_id preserved: 839
-- * city/place/restaurant/photo/festival IDs remapped to collision-free ranges
-- * local references rewired
-- * file-defined custom tags resolved by tag name (avoids cross-state tag-ID clashes)
-- * national metadata added: India / IN / TN, stable keys + SHA-256 hashes
-- * Google Place IDs explicitly held as NULL in sidecar tables
-- * original place descriptions, verification notes, costs, hours and source text preserved
